    "(excluded)": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "1. In System Settings → Accessibility, click the (–) minus button to remove every Glotty entry, then relaunch Glotty and grant fresh.": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "2. From Terminal:": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "A popup appears with the translation, no focus stolen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "弹窗会显示翻译,不会抢占焦点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short blurb about your learning goals or background — fed into LLM prompts so suggestions feel tailored. Optional.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "简单介绍一下你的学习目标或背景 —— 会传给 LLM 让建议更贴合你。可选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API keys": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
