      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Contexts let you keep parallel sets of memories. When a context is active, its memories inject alongside Global ones; memories scoped to other contexts stay dormant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下文让你可以保存多组平行的记忆。当某个上下文处于激活状态时,它的记忆会和全局记忆一起注入;其他上下文的记忆保持休眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daily": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
