            "value": "详细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dev builds are ad-hoc signed, so each rebuild has a different code signature. macOS's TCC tracks per-signature — your previous grant may belong to an older build. Two things to try:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发版本使用临时签名,所以每次重新构建签名都不一样。macOS 的 TCC 按签名记录权限 —— 之前的授权可能属于旧版本。可以试试这两个方法:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
